@page "/disclaimer"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Disclaimer & Policies - Castle of Happiness</PageTitle>

<style>
    .card {
        scroll-margin-top: 100px;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .card:target {
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.4) !important;
        border-color: #0d6efd !important;
        background-color: #f8faff;
        animation: highlightPulse 2s ease-out;
    }
    @@keyframes highlightPulse {
        0% { background-color: #e7f1ff; }
        100% { background-color: #f8faff; }
    }
    .section-link {
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    @@keyframes fadeOut {
        0% { opacity: 1; }
        80% { opacity: 1; }
        100% { opacity: 0; display: none; }
    }
</style>



<div class="container mt-4 mb-5 position-relative">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Disclaimer & Policies</h1>

    <div id="general-rules" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                General Betting Rules
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('general-rules')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">
                Castle of Happiness is powered by Kambi. All wagers are settled in accordance with the Kambi Sportsbook General Betting Rules.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    

    
    <div id="live-betting" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                Live Betting & Odds Changes
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('live-betting')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <div class="alert alert-warning mb-4 border-warning border-start border-4 shadow-sm" role="alert">
                <strong><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2"></i>Important:</strong> Before sending in your live bet, write <strong>"Live?"</strong> in your Discord channel and await a message back from an admin to ensure that we are available to accept it.
            </div>
            <p class="card-text text-muted">
                When placing a live bet, you may cancel it at any time <strong>before</strong> it is accepted by us. Once accepted, the bet is final and stands as is.
            </p>
            <p class="card-text text-muted">
                Odds fluctuate rapidly during live games. If a game event causes the odds to increase or decrease while your bet is pending, it is <strong class="text-dark">your responsibility</strong> to cancel the bet if you no longer want the odds you originally submitted.
            </p>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">
                If the odds change to your disadvantage, you are still bound by the odds you explicitly sent.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="outcome-corrections" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center">
                Outcome Corrections & Adjustments
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('outcome-corrections')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text">
                While we strive for perfect accuracy through a combination of automated extraction and manual administrative review, errors can occasionally occur. Castle of Happiness reserves the right to retroactively correct and update the final outcome of any settled bet for up to 30 days following its completion, should it be determined that the initial settlement or manual review was incorrect.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="odds-adjustment" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                Odds Adjustment Policy
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('odds-adjustment')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                To ensure we provide the fastest possible service and maintain access to the best market rates, Castle of Happiness rounds all odds down to the nearest 0.05 increment. This prevents delays caused by minor, real-time market fluctuations.
            </p>
            <div class="alert alert-info mb-0 border-info border-start border-4 shadow-sm" role="alert">
                <strong><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-2"></i>Example:</strong> Odds of 2.57 will be processed as 2.55.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="free-bet-policy" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                Free Bet Policy
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('free-bet-policy')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                Free Bets are awarded as "Net Free Bets". This means that when a wager is placed using a Free Bet, only the net winnings (total return minus the original Free Bet stake) will be credited to your account balance if the bet wins. The original Free Bet stake is not returned.
            </p>
            <div class="alert alert-info mb-0 border-info border-start border-4 shadow-sm" role="alert">
                <strong><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-2"></i>Example:</strong> A 500kr Free Bet placed at odds of 3.00 would return 1000kr in net winnings (1500kr total return - 500kr stake).
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="referral-program" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                Referral Program Rules
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('referral-program')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                We reward players who bring active, genuine friends to our platform. To protect against bonus abuse, Free Bets (FB) earned through referrals are subject to specific validation conditions before they can be fully credited or cashed out.
            </p>
            
            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-steps text-primary me-2"></i>Tiered Turnover Requirements</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted mb-2">
                    The Free Bet reward is released in stages based on the referred user's total betting turnover:
                </p>
                <ul class="text-muted">
                    <li><strong>20%</strong> of the Free Bet is paid out when the new user reaches <strong>5,000 kr</strong> in turnover.</li>
                    <li>An additional <strong>30%</strong> is paid out when the new user reaches <strong>15,000 kr</strong> in total turnover.</li>
                    <li>The final <strong>50%</strong> is paid out when the new user reaches <strong>30,000 kr</strong> in total turnover.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-bullseye text-primary me-2"></i>Minimum Odds</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                    Only settled bets placed with odds of <strong>1.50 or higher</strong> count towards this turnover.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-person-plus text-primary me-2"></i>Welcome Bonus for Referred Users</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                    New users who join through a referral link are eligible for a welcome bonus in the form of a Net Free Bet. To unlock this welcome bonus, the new user must first place settled bets totaling the welcome bonus amount on markets with minimum odds of <strong>1.50</strong>.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-secondary mb-0 border-secondary border-start border-4 shadow-sm" role="alert">
                <strong><i class="bi bi-shield-check me-2"></i>Anti-Fraud Policy:</strong> Castle of Happiness reserves the right to withhold referral bonuses or cancel pending Free Bets if we detect coordinated betting, matched betting, or fake accounts designed solely to exploit the referral program.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="settlement-days" class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                Settlement Days
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('settlement-days')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>
            <p class="card-text text-muted mb-0">
                On settlement days, you must settle your account based on your current Balance, even if you have unsettled bets. We run our settlement process just after <strong class="text-dark">23:59 on Sunday</strong> evenings. Whatever your Balance is at that time determines what you owe. Even if you have a bet that settles on Monday, you must pay your full negative Balance as it stood on Sunday at 23:59.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="withdrawal-policy" class="card shadow-sm mb-5">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                Withdrawal Policy
                <span class="ms-2 text-primary section-link fs-5" onclick="copySectionLink('withdrawal-policy')" title="Copy direct link to this section">
                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                </span>
            </h4>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-clock text-primary me-2"></i>Weekly Payout Schedule</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                    To receive your payout on Monday, your withdrawal request must be submitted before kl. 23:59 on Sunday. Any requests placed after 23:59 on Sunday will not be paid out on Monday, and you will have to wait until the settlement on the following Monday.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock text-primary me-2"></i>Weekly Withdrawal Limit</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                    To maintain platform security and ensure stable operational liquidity, the maximum allowable withdrawal is strictly capped at <strong>50,000 kr per individual player per week</strong>. This financial safeguard protects the ecosystem from unnecessary risk exposure caused by abnormally large, sudden transactions, allowing us to guarantee a reliable payout experience for all users.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-gift text-primary me-2"></i>Free Bet Turnover Requirement</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                    New customers who receive a Free Bet must meet a turnover requirement before any funds can be withdrawn. The required turnover is <strong>3x the Free Bet amount</strong>, and only settled bets with odds of <strong>1.50 or higher</strong> count towards this requirement.
                    <br />
                    <span class="text-secondary small"><em>(Example: If you receive a 2,500 kr Free Bet, you must place eligible bets totaling 7,500 kr before initiating a withdrawal.)</em></span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-warning mb-0 border-warning border-start border-4 shadow-sm" role="alert">
                <strong><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2"></i>Early Withdrawals:</strong> Early withdrawals or withdrawals requested outside of the standard payment day are subject to a 25% fee.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>